# F1 (MEASURE): per-card host->device bandwidth on the served (1, 4) mesh, x16 against x4 (scripts/ci/tp4_h2d_probe.py; docs/tp4-fabric-upload.md section 3).
# Arms: links (each position's chip, PCIe speed/width, port chain and IOMMU group), subset (the relay's host leg: ONE coordinate of a mesh tensor written two ways -
# a single-device host tensor into a get_device_tensors view, which the pinned runtime is read to replicate to every card ('broadcast' expected), and a host tensor
# built with a one-coordinate MeshMapperConfig, which should write that card only; the other three must keep their sentinel), alone (each card alone through the
# one-coordinate write when it qualified, else (1, 1) submeshes; pre-converted host tensors, ROW_MAJOR 16 KiB pages at 4/16/64/256/1024 MiB - 16 and 64 straddle the
# 32 MiB pinned zero-copy threshold - TILE bf16 and bfloat8_b at 64/256 MiB, first call apart, every size read back and compared), together (the four cards in one
# call, sharded and replicated), restore (the production GDN checkpoint's 96 tensors through _qwen_prefix_restore's h2d path, conversion and copies timed apart),
# convert (host-only from_torch cost per format).
# READ: 'H2D_PROBE verdict=MEASURED' (INEXACT = a shard holds bytes nobody wrote: stop; PARTIAL = read the problems lines). The verdict line carries decide()'s
# inputs (widths, alone_gbps, together_s); the subset arm's mapper method must be 'exact' for the relay's host leg ('broadcast' on the view method is expected).
# Measurement only: no model is loaded, nothing is served, no default changes. The probe opens the mesh once and closes it; a failed run needs a reset first.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the fabric-upload pack (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway
# commit of the branch and push the job's tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has the order, the minutes and every rule.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset fabric
C2_FABRIC_PROBE=h2d
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
